# The demo video's narration and music (D246): bought by `npm run story:narration`, never
# committed. Their .prov.json records and polyweave's ledgers are.
demo/narration/**/*.mp3
# The demo store's photos (D265): bought by `npm run demo:photos`, never committed; the seed draws
# its own pictures without them. Their .prov.json records are committed.
demo/photos/**/*.png
# The demo video's B-roll (D261): fetched from Pixabay by `npm run demo:broll`, several MB each.
# Their .json records (source, author, licence) are committed.
demo/broll/*.mp4
# The demo video's opening animation (made with Gemini), 5.6 MB; intro.json is committed.
demo/intro/*.mp4
